{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"v1_0","type":"text","text":"## v1.0 — Initial Template\n**2026-01-05**\n\n- EIC node (single agent)\n- 10 base prompts (EIC, GWR, DIR, RVA, ARP, IWA, ...)\n- STT/TTS/wakeword settings\n- `.claude/skills` subtree\n- Basic folder structure","x":-540,"y":-160,"width":400,"height":180,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"v0_0_13","type":"text","text":"## v0.0.13 — Gobi 3.0\n**2026-03-03**\n\n- `.gobi/` directory + settings.yaml\n- BRAIN.md, BRAIN_PROMPT.md, VAULTS.md\n- EDM, GDR, TIU, ACB nodes\n- New prompts: DDO, ICB, DRB, EDM, ACB\n- Removed: PBC, CTP, STT/TTS settings\n- Skills → `_Settings_/Skills/`\n- gobi-cli, gobi-onboarding skills\n- `.claude/skills` symlink","x":-540,"y":80,"width":400,"height":220,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"v0_0_20","type":"text","text":"## v0.0.20 — Capture Infra\n**2026-03-13**\n\n- `captures_dir` + `capture_prompt_path`\n- PBU prompt (Post Brain Update)\n- New bases: Participants, Publish, Skills\n- `_Outbox_/BrainUpdates/`\n- AGENTS.md expansion (Skills, Search)\n- ai4pkm-cli vault-update module\n- `_Settings_/History/Capture/`","x":-540,"y":360,"width":400,"height":200,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"v0_0_27","type":"text","text":"## v0.0.27 — Polish + Safety\n**2026-03-18**\n\n- AGENTS.md Gobi Space Features section\n- CLAUDE.md → references AGENTS.md\n- Onboarding v3.14 (community integration)\n- Version field in orchestrator.yaml\n- `id` / `name` root fields\n- **Pre-migration backup (Step 0)**\n- **Protected .gobi/ files (no overwrite)**\n- **All gh api URLs quoted**","x":-540,"y":620,"width":400,"height":220,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"fresh_install","type":"text","text":"## Fresh Install Flow\n\n**FI-1**: Scaffold directories\n**FI-2**: Fetch root configs\n**FI-3**: Fetch .gobi/ config\n**FI-4**: Fetch prompts, bases, templates\n**FI-5**: Fetch skills (recursive)\n**FI-6**: Create .claude/skills symlink\n**FI-7**: Optional git init\n\nConflict: ask user (overwrite/skip/merge)","x":940,"y":140,"width":400,"height":300,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"# Vault Evolution & Migration\nai4pkm-vault template v1.0 → v0.0.27","x":-540,"y":-400,"width":500,"height":120},
		{"id":"route_enrichment","type":"text","text":"## Route: Brain Enrichment\ngobi brain publish / post-update","x":980,"y":1360,"width":300,"height":80,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"route_onboarding","type":"text","text":"## Route: gobi-onboarding\nFull onboarding or Step 4 only","x":380,"y":1360,"width":300,"height":80,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"onboarding","type":"text","text":"## Step 6: Auto-invoke Onboarding\n\n- **Fresh install** → full gobi-onboarding\n- **Upgrade (no/template BRAIN.md)** → onboarding\n- **Upgrade (rich BRAIN.md)** → brain enrichment\n\n\"마이그레이션이 완료됐어요! 이제 온보딩을 시작할게요.\"","x":590,"y":1020,"width":450,"height":140,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"verify","type":"text","text":"## Verification\n\n- Structure: .gobi/, BRAIN.md, VAULTS.md\n- Folders: History, Capture, Documents, Canvas\n- Orchestrator: all fields, nodes, version\n- Prompts & Bases: complete set\n- Track in `.gobi/migrations.yaml`","x":590,"y":840,"width":450,"height":140,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"epoch1","type":"text","text":"## Epoch 1: Foundation\nv1.0 → v0.0.13\n\n1. Remove STT/TTS/wakeword fields\n2. Add directory config fields\n3. Add EDM/GDR/TIU/ACB nodes\n4. Create `.gobi/`, BRAIN.md, VAULTS.md\n5. Create folders (History, Documents, Canvas)\n6. Add DDO/ICB/DRB/EDM/ACB prompts\n7. Remove PBC/CTP prompts","x":380,"y":40,"width":440,"height":260,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"vault_root","type":"text","text":"## Step 0: Vault Root Detection\n\n- Check CWD for `orchestrator.yaml` / `.obsidian/`\n- Walk up to 5 parent directories\n- Warn if inside template repo","x":380,"y":-400,"width":440,"height":120,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"mode_detect","type":"text","text":"## Step 1: Mode Detection\n\n- **No orchestrator.yaml + no _Settings_/** → Fresh Install\n- **orchestrator.yaml < v0.0.27** → Upgrade\n- **v0.0.27** → Up-to-date (verify only)","x":380,"y":-220,"width":440,"height":140,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"epoch2","type":"text","text":"## Epoch 2: Capture\nv0.0.13 → v0.0.20\n\n1. Add captures_dir config\n2. Create Capture folder\n3. Add PBU prompt\n4. Add Participants/Publish/Skills bases\n5. Create BrainUpdates outbox\n6. Expand AGENTS.md sections","x":380,"y":350,"width":440,"height":180,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"epoch3","type":"text","text":"## Epoch 3: Polish\nv0.0.20 → v0.0.27\n\n1. Add AGENTS.md Gobi sections\n2. Update CLAUDE.md references\n3. Update onboarding skill\n4. Set version to 0.0.27\n5. Add id/name fields","x":380,"y":570,"width":440,"height":160,"color":"5"}
	],
